'''Filibuster Obstructa''' (スターフィリバスター, ''Sutā Firibasutā'', '''Star Filibuster''') is an enemy introduced in [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)|Filibuster Invasion]], which overrides a random [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3 stage upon clearing the chapter. After beating the stage, he will be unlocked as the [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]], [[Filibuster Cat X (Special Cat)|Filibuster Cat X]]. Clearing all [[Zombie Outbreaks]] and [[A Whole New World]] causes [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)/Outbreak|another Filibuster Invasion]] to appear, which can be beaten for a [[Legend Capsules (Gacha Event)|Legend Ticket]] and his allied self's [[Talents]]. He was added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]].

