==Enemy==
In [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)|Filibuster Invasion]], Filibuster Obstructa will always destroy the [[Cat Base]] in one hit, and his extreme [[Long Distance]] reach allows him to easily reach it regardless of his position. Your goal is to prevent him from ever completing his attack animation. His second stage, [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)/Outbreak|Filibuster Invasion Outbreak]] is wide enough for him to potentially miss the Cat Base if it's far enough away, making it worthwhile to try and keep him close to the enemy base.

His attack animation is 40 seconds long and he has 200 knockbacks, making it fairly easy to interrupt him, as only 10,000 damage is needed to trigger a knockback. The problem lies in his immunity to the [[Cat Cannon]] and [[Wave Attack]]s, not to mention his massive standing range, which makes him hard to reach with all kinds of enemies in front of him.

