==Trivia==
*He is based on [[Evangelist Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Evangelist Cat]]'s Evolved Form, Filibuster Cat.
*Filibuster Obstructa's name is derived from the very definition of the word itself. To engage in a filibuster means to prolong a speech to the point of obstructing progress in a legislative assembly. In a sense, his name also serves as a guide on how to defeat him: through obstructing his very long attack animation.
**"Obstructa" could also be a reference to Filibuster Cat's Japanese description, which states that he can "obstruct the flow" (流れを妨害することができる).
*He is the only [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] to have neither [[Warp]] nor [[Barrier]] abilities and the only Starred Alien to be an enemy version of a [[Filibuster Cat X (Special Cat)|Cat Unit]].
*He has the second highest base attack power of all enemies, standing at 1 million, barely surpassing the [[Dummy (Enemy Base)|Dummy]]'s and [[Teacher Cybear]]'s 999,999 damage and only surpassed by [[Metafilibuster (Enemy)|Metafilibuster]]'s 3 million damage. However, due to his 45.03-second attack rate, he's still a long way off from having the highest DPS.
*He has the longest effective range and is tied with [[Sunrise Doge]] for the second-longest standing range of all enemies, with [[Shin Godzilla]] in first place.
*He is tied with his variant Metafilibuster for the longest foreswing in the game.
*Prior to [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3.2]], Filibuster Obstructa had an effective range of 50~4050, rather than 300~4300. This would cause him to stand 50 range away from the base, and thus in front of the enemies designed to protect him. This change was made to prevent the player from cheesing [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)|the original Filibuster Invasion]] easily with [[Sniper the Cat]].
*The main loop of the [https://youtu.be/C-C0WdLsKyU Filibuster Invasion theme] is exactly 40 seconds long, which is the same as Filibuster Obstructa's attack foreswing.
*In [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)/Outbreak]], if the player is missing enough [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], the 200% Filibuster Obstructa's damage (up to 32000000) can cause an integer overflow into the negatives, rendering its attacks harmless. For more information, see [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jr50WNVK3lw this video].

